{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "a8893a65-d395-80cb-8a92-30df308ce3df",
  "created_at": "2025-12-19T11:36:24-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Ivan Tavares",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Kevin Sousa",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-19T11:34:31-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Kevin."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-19T11:34:33-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hello, Kevin! Great, thank you for picking up. This is Ivan Tavares. I'm calling about the trash pickup schedule. What is the new schedule after the holiday week?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-19T11:34:43-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure, happy to look that up. Which address are we talking about?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-19T11:34:48-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "309 Ruggles Avenue, up on the Hill. Wonderful."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-19T11:34:51-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, 309 Ruggles. Let me pull up your route. Give me one second, I'm just writing this down as I go. Ruggles, Historic Hill... [pause] Alright."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-19T11:35:00-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Take your time! I'm not going anywhere. Oh, and I should say, at my house we speak three languages, so sometimes I switch in the middle of a sentence. If I do, just ask me again, okay? Está bem?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-19T11:35:13-05:00",
      "duration": 16,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Ha, no problem at all, I'll keep up. So for your street, the pickup day normally runs on your regular day, and in the holiday weeks it gets pushed back a day after the holiday. Christmas falls on a Thursday this year, so your Thursday collection would slide to Friday."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-19T11:35:29-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Great! So Christmas week, Friday instead of Thursday. And after that? New Year's is also Thursday, correct? Same thing?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-19T11:35:36-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Same thing. New Year's Day is a Thursday, so that one slides to Friday too. Then the week of the fifth it's back to your normal Thursday."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-19T11:35:45-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Wonderful! Friday the twenty-sixth and Friday the second, then Thursday the eighth. Wait, the fifth week, so Thursday the eighth, yes?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-19T11:35:52-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thursday the eighth, yes. You've got it. Recycling follows the same shift on its week."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-19T11:35:58-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Great, great. One more thing. Is there a fee for any of this? For the shifted pickup, I mean, or extra bags?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-19T11:36:06-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, no fee for the schedule change, it's the same service just a day later. Just have your bins or bags out by the usual time that morning."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-19T11:36:16-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Perfect! Wonderful! That is everything I needed. Obrigado, Kevin, and happy holidays!"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-19T11:36:21-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You too, Mr. Tavares. Take care."
    }
  ],
